<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Carrefour.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Carrefour.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 200,000 European-style call warrants, in two-equal tranches, on Carrefour ordinary shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>ONE WARRANT CONTROLS ONE SHARE.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	31.MAR.00		 PAYDATE	23.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  3479 FRF</p>
<p>* * *  * * * * * *</p>
<p>  TYPE	STRIKE	ISSUE     B/E PREEMIUM  GEARING</p>
<p>  CALL	3500 FRF    866.5 FRF 25.10 PCT	4.02 X</p>
<p>  CALL	4000 FRF    693.5 FRF 34.90 PCT	5.02 X</p>
<p>  NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
